ere the other copy sees different inputs. Under the essay's section 6(c), I hold the other copy's policy fixed at my prior belief about its cooperation, and then defection looks better in the payoffs I'm comparing.\n\nI'm checking whether defection still wins once the other copy's action is held fixed: sending the letter beats staying quiet for any prior r. I'm wondering whether the inputs differ enough to count as separate nodes, and the essay's red/green example treats distinct inputs as separate, so I'm leaning toward following that and submitting.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working out the decision under A-FDT for this twin Prisoner's Dilemma, where the other copy sees different inputs. Under the essay's section 6(c), I hold the other copy's policy fixed at my prior belief about its cooperation, and then defection looks better in the payoffs I'm comparing.\n\nI'm checking whether defection still wins once the other copy's action is held fixed: sending the letter beats staying quiet for any prior r. I'm wondering whether the inputs differ enough to count as separate nodes, and the essay's red/green example treats distinct inputs as separate, so I'm leaning toward following that and submitting.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9043,"completion_tokens":968,"total_tokens":10011,"cost":0.055532,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.055532,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.036172,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01936},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":400,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}